{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL04.6",
  "chapter": "NL04",
  "title": "幂主值与「不是实数幂」",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p4-complex.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:448ff3c6af38ff4ed96394fa55217375f859fe35ecad4b3592c77907b51339c1"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "fab7c610587a6c79a1d77ca4e1d5ec3006c808ca",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$z^{w}=\\exp(w\\log z)$，取 $\\log$ 的主值即得幂的主值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它说明「分数次幂」在复域天然多值；求根、算 $\\sqrt[3]{\\cdot}$ 都要先决定分支。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$(-8)^{1/3}$ 的主值是 $1+1.732i$，**不是**$-2$。成立条件：$z\\ne0$（$0^{0}$ 与 $0^{w}$ 另议）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "无。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "C4、C5。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.6:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为复数的幂可以「先化成实数再算」。一旦底数为负或指数非整数，\n实数路径给出的那个根只是若干分支中的一个，且常不是主值。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "kind": "library-know",
    "surveyId": "C6",
    "status": "已实现：core/complex.hpp",
    "section": "复分析：多值性不是缺陷，是定义的一部分"
  }
}
